{"sourceUrl":"https://chem.ecnu.edu.cn/b4/12/c26579a766994/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:14.162806+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://chem.ecnu.edu.cn/b4/12/c26579a766994/page.htm","html":"<div><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span>为促进优秀大学生之间的交流，增进优秀大学生对华东师范大学化学与分子工程学院的了解，扩大化学与分子工程学院在国内高校中的影响力和知名度，我院将于</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>年暑假期间举办“全国优秀大学生夏令营”活动。</span></span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://chem.ecnu.edu.cn/b4/12/c26579a766994/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://chem.ecnu.edu.cn/b4/12/c26579a766994/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span><span>华东师范大学化学与分子工程学院</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>年“全国优秀大学生夏令营”拟于</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>16-17</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>日举行。欢迎广大学生踊跃报名参加。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>一、招生对象</span></span></span></p><p><span> “<span><span>全国优秀大学生夏令营”招生面向全国高等院校本科</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>2023</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>级（拟</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>年夏毕业）有志攻读硕士、博士研究生的优秀本科在校大学生。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>二、申请条件</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>、拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>、学习成绩优异；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>、报考专业相关的学科背景，立志成为学术创新型人才或高层次实践创新型人才；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>、具有较强的英语听说和写作能力。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>三、举办时间和内容形式</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>年我院夏令营活动线下举办。暂定时间：</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>16-17</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>日。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>人数：选拔约</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>80</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>名营员参加。 </span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>主要日程安排：（以下为暂定活动日程，具体安排可能会根据情况进行适当调整，以届时邮件通知为准）</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>第一天：举行开营仪式，以及各学科介绍讲座、知名教授代表学术报告、交流讨论等活动；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span> 第二天：各学科和营员的座谈活动。 </span></span></p><p><span><span><span>四、报名方式</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>系统报名开始时间：</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日，</span></span><span>截止时间为</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>8</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span><span>。</span></span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://chem.ecnu.edu.cn/b4/12/c26579a766994/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://chem.ecnu.edu.cn/b4/12/c26579a766994/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>、申请路径：华东师范大学研究生报考服务系统</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>(<a href=\"https://yjszs-ks.ecnu.edu.cn/logon?zsxm=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://yjszs-ks.ecnu.edu.cn/logon?zsxm=4</a>  )—</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>全国优秀大学生夏令营。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>特别提醒：请务必确认拟报考专业的准确性。我院只接受每位考生申请我院其中一个专业</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>/</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>方向的夏令营，</span><span><span>请勿提交超过一个申请</span></span><span>。 </span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>、填写个人信息（需确保填写正确且真实有效信息，</span><span><span>请仔细检查后再提交，特别是邮箱和电话）。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>、按要求上传材料。材料包括：</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>(1)</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>居民身份证（正反面）；</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>(2)</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>夏令营诚信承诺书；</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>(3)</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>华东师范大学优秀大学生夏令营申请表；</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>(4)</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>其他科研背景相关材料：可包含论文发表、获奖证明等材料。注：考生可根据实际情况上传材料，材料</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>(4)</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>需合并成一个</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>pdf</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>材料上传。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>注：所有材料于系统中提交电子版即可，无需邮寄纸质材料。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>、申请信息填写完毕，</span><span><span>请务必检查所有信息无误后，再点击“</span></span><span><span>确认并提交”，</span></span><span>提交这一步是报名的必须步骤。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>、学生报名后，在报名时间截止前，可以自己撤销提交并进行修改。报名时间截止后，无法进行修改。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>：点击“申请院系开放查询”，看到页面，点击查看后，可以看到各院系夏令营工作通知。申请完成后，可以查看申请状态与结果。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>五、营员遴选与评价 </span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>我院将结合各学科招生规模、结构、高质量生源目标等条件，对申请者进行审查和筛选，预计将在</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>13</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>日前后在系统中公布入选营员的名单，请申请者务必及时关注系统信息，登录报名系统查询是否入选营员。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>入选的营员请及时在系统中确认是否参加，反馈是否参加的截止时间以邮件通知为准，</span></span><span>逾期未确认视为放弃此资格。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>六、其他事宜 </span></span></span></p><p><span>  <span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>、营员入选后须全程参与夏令营的各项活动，遵守夏令营的各项安排。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>、我院将为入选的营员提供在沪期间的伙食（</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>16</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>-7</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>17</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>日）和住宿（含</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>15</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>日和</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>16</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>日两晚的住宿，本校学生不安排住宿）。往返差旅费由营员自理。</span></span></span></p><p><span>  <span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>、申请者必须保证所提交申请材料的真实性和准确性。因材料弄虚作假或行为违规、作弊等而谋利的，一旦查实将取消获取的资格、结果。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>、营员在夏令营期间如发生医疗费用及个人行为导致的意外事故，由营员本人及其派出单位承担。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>、联系方式：</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>教育类（含学科教学化学）、化学（化学教育、国优专项）、材料与化工负责老师：金老师，联系邮箱：</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>cjin@chem.ecnu.edu.cn.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://chem.ecnu.edu.cn/b4/12/c26579a766994/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://chem.ecnu.edu.cn/b4/12/c26579a766994/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://chem.ecnu.edu.cn/b4/12/c26579a766994/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://chem.ecnu.edu.cn/b4/12/c26579a766994/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span><span>无机化学、分析化学、有机化学、物理化学和高分子化学和物理（硕士和直博生）负责老师：王老师，联系邮箱：</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>wangtingting@chem.ecnu.edu.cn.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span>   </span></p><div><p><br/></p></div><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"5e98a87ff16c96f5da3f880bbd74ba89e9d3091a7d8984d312954970bfda15bb","textLength":1534,"sourceSha256":"b09ab835a17fa91c2f054afc9b32beef4a652b1ced4f887c89dd28fd0a3eeb78","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-15a73b02c6a109c1d03f","title":"2026年华东师范大学化学与分子工程学院“全国优秀大学生夏令营”活动方案","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:14.162806+00:00"}
